=== task: predict easy
title: Adding up to five
code:
```python
def with_total(items, target, i, path, total, results):
    if total > target:
        return
    if i == len(items):
        if total == target:
            results.append(path[:])
        return
    path.append(items[i])
    with_total(items, target, i + 1, path, total + items[i], results)
